#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_advanced_user_tools.rst:408
#: 0bc8e67acda1413d9f17c770b61eba6b 13f4a5d1bdd0407782aee8669e773457
#: 34998416676148068249c8096053b557 7b90b9c29bad45809dd4284a48af0742
#: 8c279295ce354e13b3f483440cc75317 a0f8f5bd3d9f4432b0b2501f31bef5b4
#: ad312deb453b4cb1a33c96bba1dca42e b0b92a7060ac4574b0e9d6b5543215c7
#: b78e7b7996454dc3ad0e8fa8a6dcd913 cf35fc679aab4458a6c78b2de33da152
#: dd86cfed22264cd78eaed76bba678b5c efca7a0e7a764daa866df8db8422ebff
msgid ""
"Operating a powered vehicle of any kind can be a lot of fun. However, "
"nothing will ruin your day at the park more quickly than an accident or "
"running afoul of the law. Since we want you to have a great experience, "
"please make sure that you do all of the following:"
msgstr "操作任何类型的动力飞行器都非常有趣。但是，在公园发生事故或触犯法律会让您的一天迅速毁掉。为了确保您拥有良好的体验，请务必做到以下几点："

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_advanced_user_tools.rst:412
#: 466a999d4e9044808b7da504e65fce50 4db86947312849e9b98a96083e9556b1
#: 6aa8c5dc6421466fb13a6f225a999a5c 801cbcb6bc0d49d5979596e04adc7ed3
#: 860d7662c1cd4715ace597f0ee0f1be4 8779bb305b3843659061a433586c9539
#: 91be4abf6d214d879b1d069dff595e99 ada4a9dd4925444e9328ec5976691cca
#: adb281d327d74839ac332811d2d2d238 aec0ab4e154140a3ade1c97d3ae3b22c
#: af46d5427a7447908d45c185619ff345 c21e43861cd14fbb8e974022a2553901
msgid ""
"Operate within all local laws and regulations. For example, in the United "
"States, current regulations require you to operate most UAVs under 400 foot "
"above ground level, within line of site, and away from obstructions and "
"populated areas. Since these regulations vary from place to place, even "
"within the same country, ensure that you understand what you need to do to "
"stay compliant."
msgstr ""
"遵守所有当地法律法规。例如，在美国，现行法规要求您在地面上方400英尺以下、视线范围内、远离障碍物和人口密集区操作大多数无人机。由于这些法规因地而异，即使在同一国家内也可能不同，请确保您了解如何保持合规。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_advanced_user_tools.rst:417
#: 055d76bc03a34ac5afa639b5e52a265f 17708d43d40d41f0ad4367a54139853c
#: 1e86afafda994bbb869bb150e514777b 3d7bba1e70a340c9b6967fedcf34b025
#: 48f2928a8a324d42953acdaf71d1f597 511e0dc8c07644ca91db2d0f751a56b3
#: 5831e879d8ba4534ae149cde45d36d6a 7139d43917224dceb681ed1468b56ef4
#: 7aeddd4a572d44d59d6bb6b5f1c6ccde 9a0a2099893b4157989a342d0aaf6d07
#: c2c7bb8730e34677bbfd75bbddc901b3 ea2674a49fd14487a61a667e7cd6554b
msgid ""
"Never operate the vehicle or software in a way that could be dangerous to "
"you, other people, or property. Propellers, while rotating, could easily cut"
" you; if a UAV fell on a person or object, it could cause injury; a UAV "
"caught in power lines could cause an outage. As Ben Franklin said, “An ounce"
" of prevention is worth a pound of cure.”"
msgstr ""
"切勿以可能对您、他人或财产造成危险的方式操作飞行器或软件。旋转中的螺旋桨可能轻易割伤您；无人机落在人或物体上可能造成伤害；无人机卡入电线可能导致停电。正如本杰明·富兰克林所说，「一盎司的预防胜过一磅的治疗。」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-downloads_advanced_user_tools.rst:421
#: 0d3bdb087a0d434387fbfa36a90dd1ca 288b4ffd44c64111af801fe78395fa86
#: 342056e4ca544d5d887930c651bd25b0 36eed82c862346d7b791f28a1250dd82
#: 6ff2b472e2c24e1199f8c0542dd84e63 bf89e9ca019e4d4283feb9bd97ecad58
#: d0013a47fcd14512b3e639d8a6d7b730 d7677ac1fa57442eb98991f539456bb8
#: dbaf6aa2b7744e7ab5602b2b8da036ca e34d5e0a1b914cbcb2107776fa1ce499
#: f18c9475f47f45158a49d843195ea61b fe008a5813d2409b92f38aedca68365b
msgid ""
"Always keep in mind that software and hardware failures happen. Although we "
"design our products to minimize such issues, you should always operate with "
"the understanding that a failure could occur at any point of time and "
"without warning. As such, you should take the appropriate precautions to "
"minimize danger in case of failure."
msgstr ""
"始终牢记软件和硬件故障随时可能发生。尽管我们尽量设计产品以减少此类问题，但您应始终以随时可能发生故障且无任何预警为前提进行操作。因此，您应采取适当的预防措施，以在发生故障时将危险降至最低。"

